            "review_text": "Stefano P\nManila, Philippines2 contributions\n0\nFood was amazing and the stuff was extremely nice, gave us recommendations and explained the concept and every dish.\nApr 2024 • Family\nIt was recommended by our hotel staff. As we arrived we were greeted warmly by the restaurant staff members. I noticed someone looking like the boss sitting at a table talking to the potential new hires 😀 so I asked and it turned out to be Co Hong the restaurant owner. She did chat with us and introduced the famous dishes at her place. Our favorite was the Mackerel rice paper dish with two delicious dipping sauces.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 24, 2024",
