            "review_text": "Luz Li\nNew Taipei, Taiwan367 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese Delight\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nWhile searching for authentic Vietnamese cuisine, we stumbled upon this gem of a restaurant. Our dining experience was nothing short of an adventure, with flavors that delighted our taste buds and service that was both attentive and friendly. The staff graciously guided us through the enjoyment of our orders: the Quang Noodles and the Rice Paper Rolls with Pork. Both dishes were a symphony of fresh herbs, crunchy vegetables, and a zesty dressing that left us craving for more. A must-visit for anyone looking to savor the true essence of Vietnamese cuisine!\nRead more\nWritten February 29, 2024",
